        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904260/extras/bb74060aeb9fbd38660cbd2aa2d83314.poster.avif?t=1768992354\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904260/extras/bb74060aeb9fbd38660cbd2aa2d83314.webm?t=1768992354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904260/extras/bb74060aeb9fbd38660cbd2aa2d83314.mp4?t=1768992354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gunfight Arena</strong> is a fast-paced top-down PvP shooter set in a futuristic sci-fi battlefield where every shot counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against other players in intense online matches where powerful weapons spawn randomly across the map. Everyone starts with a basic pistol, but by taking out opponents and grabbing better gear—like shotguns, pulse rifles, or ricocheting projectiles—you can gain the upper hand. Die, and you return to your default weapon.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️ Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online multiplayer</strong> for 2–6 players in high-speed PvP matches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One-hit kills</strong> – every bullet is deadly, and precision is everything.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A variety of powerful sci-fi weapons</strong> that spawn dynamically on the map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic sci-fi arena design</strong> with different obstacle types: shoot-through walls, full cover, fogged areas, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill-based, no pay-to-win mechanics</strong> – just pure competitive gameplay.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gunfight Arena</strong> is built for short, intense play sessions with tight controls and clean visuals. Whether you're in it for quick matches with your friends, Arena is waiting for you!!!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>JOIN OUR DISCORD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to learn more about the game, get early insights into upcoming features and mechanics, or even support the development as a future <strong>playtester</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our community on Discord to stay up to date with behind-the-scenes updates and development progress.<br>Information about future <strong>playtesting</strong> opportunities will be shared there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be part of the journey from day one!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904260/extras/bb74060aeb9fbd38660cbd2aa2d83314.poster.avif?t=1768992354\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904260/extras/bb74060aeb9fbd38660cbd2aa2d83314.webm?t=1768992354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904260/extras/bb74060aeb9fbd38660cbd2aa2d83314.mp4?t=1768992354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gunfight Arena</strong> is a fast-paced top-down PvP shooter set in a futuristic sci-fi battlefield where every shot counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against other players in intense online matches where powerful weapons spawn randomly across the map. Everyone starts with a basic pistol, but by taking out opponents and grabbing better gear—like shotguns, pulse rifles, or ricocheting projectiles—you can gain the upper hand. Die, and you return to your default weapon.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️ Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online multiplayer</strong> for 2–6 players in high-speed PvP matches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One-hit kills</strong> – every bullet is deadly, and precision is everything.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A variety of powerful sci-fi weapons</strong> that spawn dynamically on the map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic sci-fi arena design</strong> with different obstacle types: shoot-through walls, full cover, fogged areas, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill-based, no pay-to-win mechanics</strong> – just pure competitive gameplay.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gunfight Arena</strong> is built for short, intense play sessions with tight controls and clean visuals. Whether you're in it for quick matches with your friends, Arena is waiting for you!!!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>JOIN OUR DISCORD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to learn more about the game, get early insights into upcoming features and mechanics, or even support the development as a future <strong>playtester</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our community on Discord to stay up to date with behind-the-scenes updates and development progress.<br>Information about future <strong>playtesting</strong> opportunities will be shared there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be part of the journey from day one!</p>",
        "short_description": "Fast-paced top-down PvP shooter where powerful weapons spawn across the map. Grab them fast, outgun your enemies—and beware: death or the ticking clock will send you back to your default gun. Outplay, survive, and claim your spot at the top. Don’t waste a second.",
